{"id":"fd01c8f753367315","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-assignment.md","title":"赋值","display":"df-assignment — 赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-assignment","aliases":["28-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — 赋值","depends_on":["[[28-df-structure]]","[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — 赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-assignment-—-赋值-$\\beta$\">df-assignment — 赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> (论域, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7046e83df52059de\" href=\"?note=7046e83df52059de\" title=\"28-df-structure\">28-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (变量符号集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\">\\(\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A\\)</span> (赋值候选)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> (变量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> (论域元素)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x](y) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}a&amp;y=x\\\\\\beta(y)&amp;y\\neq x\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/x](y) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}a&amp;y=x\\\\\\beta(y)&amp;y\\neq x\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x]\">\\(\\beta[a/x]\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 处把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 的值改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n<p>R7复核：赋值集直接构造为全部 Var→A 函数；原有单点更新接口不变。此为本地支撑定义，不宣称原书编号来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-assignment-—-赋值-$\\beta$","text":"df-assignment — 赋值 $\\beta$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})$ ($S$-结构, see [[28-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"7046e83df52059de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A=|\\mathfrak{A}|$ (论域, see [[28-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}$ (变量符号集, see [[28-df-first-order-syntax]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak{A})","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak{A}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta:\\mathrm{Var}\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak{A})\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}}","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[a/x](y) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}a&y=x\\\\\\beta(y)&y\\neq x\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[a/x]","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":1155,"backlinks":[{"id":"33292a1a991cbb70","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 的常元为 $0$，一元函数为 $S$，二元函数为 $+,\\times$，二元关系为 $<$；标准结构为 $\\mathfrak N=(\\mathbb N,0,S,+,\\times,<)$。语法、满足与自由变量来自 [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)$ 来自 [[28-df-assignment]]。\n$\\exists x<t\\,\\psi$、$\\forall x<t\\,\\psi$ 为下式构造的有界量词语法缩写，$x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)$；$\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi$ 为下式定义的标准模型等价关系。$\\bar x$ 为非空有限变量列。"},{"id":"42bd57d799b5867e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=(A,(c^{\\mathfrak A})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak A})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak A})_R),\\mathfrak B=(B,(c^{\\mathfrak B})_c,(f^{\\mathfrak B})_f,(R^{\\mathfrak B})_R)$ 是同一 $S$ 的结构，see [[28-df-structure]]。\n$\\iota:B\\to A$ 为下式量化的候选映射；赋值和满足来自 [[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"d82c10f45e77e524","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)=A^{\\mathrm{Var}}$，$\\beta[a/x]$ 见 [[28-df-assignment]]；$\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[28-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"bfb27aea6f90ca07","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\beta: \\mathrm{Var} \\to A$ (赋值, see [[28-df-assignment]])"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语法与语义：[[28-df-atomic-formula]]、[[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]、[[28-df-bound-variable]]、[[28-df-sentence]]、[[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-structure]]、[[28-df-term-interpretation]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["7046e83df52059de","acf90b9de82eb78c"]}